{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rift Survivors \u2014 Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free demo lets you experience a portion of *Rift Survivors* with the following content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 playable stages (each run consists of 3 randomized stages)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 gear items (each with 2\u20134 upgrade effects)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 rune items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dimensional Journal system (missions and permanent growth)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Approximately 30 minutes of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/179674f0078fb62a56e30721e1efc6d6.poster.avif?t=1758214113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/179674f0078fb62a56e30721e1efc6d6.webm?t=1758214113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> 1.Survive Across the Rifts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast out from their own worlds, warriors embark on a journey across dimensions to reclaim what they have lost.   <br>On the paths that connect each world, survive relentless waves of enemies.   <br>Every Rift offers unique environments and challenges \u2014 your journey is both survival and war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/a6f4075246711125170cde4cabf3799c.poster.avif?t=1758214113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/a6f4075246711125170cde4cabf3799c.webm?t=1758214113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/a6f4075246711125170cde4cabf3799c.mp4?t=1758214113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Select. Place. Grow Stronger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rift Survivors combines the fast-paced action of Survivor-like shooters   <br>with the strategic depth of an inventory-based roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the gear you acquire directly into your inventory to power up your character.   <br>What you choose and where you place it creates entirely new strategies.   <br>When you maximize efficiency within limited space, you\u2019ll feel the thrill of turning the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/cab21ff80ff4cb4730ba90189c7af927.poster.avif?t=1758214113\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/cab21ff80ff4cb4730ba90189c7af927.webm?t=1758214113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/cab21ff80ff4cb4730ba90189c7af927.mp4?t=1758214113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Conquer the Unknown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat swarms of enemies and take down powerful bosses.   <br>Step through the portal to the next dimension.   <br>Beyond the Rifts, greater challenges and rewards await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Note: This demo represents a limited portion of the full game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some features are still in development and may change before release.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023350?t=1758214113","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023350?t=1758214113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/bf01e2323273277cf7ea76f98b55704986142bd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758214113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/bf01e2323273277cf7ea76f98b55704986142bd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758214113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rift Survivors \u2014 Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free demo lets you experience a portion of *Rift Survivors* with the following content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 6 playable stages (each run consists of 3 randomized stages)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 gear items (each with 2\u20134 upgrade effects)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 rune items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dimensional Journal system (missions and permanent growth)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Approximately 30 minutes of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >### About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023350/extras/179674f0078fb62a56e30721e1efc6d6.poster.avif?t=1758214113\"